------CompoundStmt:
---------Decl: int x
------------ConstantExpr: 0
---------Decl: int sum
------------ConstantExpr: 0
---------WhileStmt
------------BinaryCmp <:
---------------IdentExpr: x
---------------ConstantExpr: 5
------------CompoundStmt:
---------------AssignStmt: x
------------------BinaryMath +:
